      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 2,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "needId": "proof:3",
            "type": "proof",
            "heading": "School PE Services and Sports Events",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "College or university lecturer and sports officer."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "options",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 3,
            "supporting": [
              "Corporate wellness, school PE services and sports events. Companies, housing societies and schools pay for programmes, camps and events. The business layer is a packaged programme you can repeat, not one more hourly job. The fitness market behind it is growing: Deloitte and the Health and Fitness Association put it at Rs 16,200 crore in 2024, heading to Rs 37,700 crore by 2030.",
              "College or university lecturer and sports officer. This needs an M.P.Ed, UGC NET or a PhD, and then a separate hiring round for few posts. Pay is on a fixed academic scale. An Assistant Professor starts at Academic Level 10 with Rs 57,700 basic under the UGC scales."
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "proof:5",
            "type": "proof",
            "heading": "Two Stages of Competition Most Guides Skip",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "No public source we found breaks out how many physical education teacher posts are vacant, so be careful with any page that claims a shortage."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "two-stage",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5,
            "supporting": [
              "No public source we found breaks out how many physical education teacher posts are vacant, so be careful with any page that claims a shortage. Overall school teacher vacancies are large, about 9.8 lakh of 69.9 lakh sanctioned posts in one 2025 analysis, but that is for all subjects and the estimates are disputed. Plan for steady demand, not a guaranteed post."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "Ordered By Headroom"
    },
